<p>The men's <a href="/wiki/ISSF_Olympic_skeet" title="ISSF Olympic skeet">skeet</a> event at the <a href="/wiki/2024_Summer_Olympics" title="2024 Summer Olympics">2024 Summer Olympics</a> took place on 2 and 3 August 2024 at the <a href="/wiki/National_Shooting_Centre_(France)" title="National Shooting Centre (France)">Chateauroux Shooting Ctr</a>. 
</p>
